#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://cartpops.com"
msgstr "https://cartpops.com"

#: cartpops.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"The #1 WooCommerce cart drawer plugin. Boost conversions with a beautiful "
"slide-out cart, product recommendations, and free shipping meter."
msgstr ""
"Det førende WooCommerce cart drawer-plugin. Boost konverteringer med en "
"flot slide-out-kurv, produktanbefalinger og måler til fri fragt."

#: cartpops.php:56
msgid ""
"CartPops detected both the Free and Pro editions as active. CartPops was "
"paused; deactivate one edition and reload this page."
msgstr ""
"CartPops registrerede både Free- og Pro-udgaven som aktive. CartPops blev "
"sat på pause; deaktiver den ene udgave, og genindlæs denne side."

#: cartpops.php:148
msgid ""
"CartPops could not safely verify upgrade state. CartPops was paused before "
"licensing initialization; reload this page or contact support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops kunne ikke bekræfte opgraderingsstatus sikkert. CartPops blev sat "
"på pause før licensinitialisering; genindlæs denne side, eller kontakt "
"support."

#: cartpops.php:406
msgid ""
"CartPops licensing could not initialize. Shared cart features remain "
"available, but paid features are paused. Reinstall the complete CartPops "
"package or contact support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops-licensering kunne ikke initialiseres. Fælles kurvfunktioner er "
"stadig tilgængelige, men betalte funktioner er sat på pause. Geninstaller "
"den komplette CartPops-pakke, eller kontakt support."

