#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1788
msgid ""
"CartPops could not finish updating your settings from version 1, so it is "
"paused. Your settings are safe. Reload this page to try again, and contact "
"CartPops support if this message stays."
msgstr ""
"CartPops kunne ikke afslutte opdateringen af dine indstillinger fra version "
"1, så den er sat på pause. Dine indstillinger er sikre. Genindlæs denne "
"side for at prøve igen, og kontakt CartPops-support, hvis denne besked "
"bliver ved med at vises."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1798
msgid ""
"Your automation rules from CartPops 1 are kept, but CartPops 2 no longer "
"runs them."
msgstr ""
"Dine automatiseringsregler fra CartPops 1 bevares, men CartPops 2 kører dem "
"ikke længere."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1821
msgid ""
"CartPops updated your settings from version 1, but some could not be "
"carried over exactly. Your original settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"CartPops opdaterede dine indstillinger fra version 1, men nogle kunne ikke "
"overføres nøjagtigt. Dine oprindelige indstillinger bevares."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1825
msgid "Hide this notice"
msgstr "Skjul denne meddelelse"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1835
msgid "This review requires a site administrator and a submitted review form."
msgstr ""
"Denne anmeldelse kræver en webstedsadministrator og en indsendt "
"anmeldelsesformular."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1852
msgid ""
"The review was not accepted. Return to this site dashboard and review the "
"current notice again."
msgstr ""
"Anmeldelsen blev ikke accepteret. Vend tilbage til dette websteds dashboard "
"og gennemgå den aktuelle meddelelse igen."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1857
msgid ""
"The saved migration state could not be acknowledged. No review was "
"accepted; return to this site dashboard and try again."
msgstr ""
"Den gemte migrationstilstand kunne ikke bekræftes. Ingen anmeldelse blev "
"accepteret; vend tilbage til dit websteds dashboard og prøv igen."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1865
msgid ""
"JavaScript retirement review accepted. Return to this site dashboard to "
"retry migration and review any remaining conditions. The original script is "
"preserved and will not execute in V2."
msgstr ""
"Anmeldelse af JavaScript-pensionering accepteret. Vend tilbage til dit "
"websteds dashboard for at prøve migrering igen og gennemgå eventuelle "
"resterende betingelser. Det oprindelige script bevares og vil ikke blive "
"udført i V2."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1909
msgid "This link has expired. Return to the dashboard and try again."
msgstr "Dette link er udløbet. Vend tilbage til dashboardet og prøv igen."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1925
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until you review your old custom JavaScript below. Your "
"settings are safe."
msgstr ""
"CartPops er sat på pause, indtil du gennemgår dit gamle brugerdefinerede "
"JavaScript nedenfor. Dine indstillinger er sikre."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1926
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until a site administrator reviews the old custom "
"JavaScript. Your settings are safe."
msgstr ""
"CartPops er sat på pause, indtil en webstedsadministrator gennemgår det "
"gamle brugerdefinerede JavaScript. Dine indstillinger er sikre."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1928
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until its update can finish. Your settings are safe. If "
"you use CartPops Pro, check that your license is active for this site; "
"otherwise, contact CartPops support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops er sat på pause, indtil opdateringen kan gennemføres. Dine "
"indstillinger er sikre. Hvis du bruger CartPops Pro, skal du kontrollere, "
"at din licens er aktiv for dette site; ellers skal du kontakte CartPops "
"support."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1938
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Få mere at vide"

