#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2023
msgid ""
"CartPops 2 does not run the custom JavaScript from version 1. It stays "
"saved in your database. Copy it if you still need it, then confirm below to "
"finish the update."
msgstr ""
"CartPops 2 kører ikke det brugerdefinerede JavaScript fra version 1. Det "
"forbliver gemt i din database. Kopier det, hvis du stadig har brug for det, "
"og bekræft derefter nedenfor for at afslutte opdateringen."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2039
